DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
672::$$$message_0001_0000_0000$$$::Thus began the ghost story of those who went to the training camp.::
673::$$$message_0001_0001_0000$$$::Issei makes a bitter expression at the big co-ed event...[lr]::
674::$$$message_0001_0001_0001$$$::"...Ahem. Well, if we're doing this, I may as well give you this."[lr]::
675::$$$message_0001_0001_0002$$$::...but he brought candles, of all things. They suit the ambiance perfectly.[lr]::
676::$$$message_0001_0001_0003$$$::In classic fashion, we all tell scary stories, each of us blowing out a candle as we finish.::
677::$$$message_0001_0002_0000$$$::An old story of dead bodies turning up in Ryudou Temple's legendary dragon cave.[lr]::
678::$$$message_0001_0002_0001$$$::A young man who went missing in an apartment.[lr]::
679::$$$message_0001_0002_0002$$$::A string leading from Shinto to the moon, and an account of a ghostly woman haunting a mansion.[lr]::
680::$$$message_0001_0002_0003$$$::Just as I start to get interested...[lr]::
681::$$$message_0001_0002_0004$$$::"...Sorry, gotta hit the toilet."[lr]::
682::$$$message_0001_0002_0005$$$::I stand up, even though I don't want to leave.[lr]::
683::$$$message_0001_0002_0006$$$::I probably just want some fresh air.::
684::$$$message_0001_0003_0000$$$::The night chill hits my skin once I step outside.[lr]::
685::$$$message_0001_0003_0001$$$::The air in the mountains is colder and sharper than in the city.[lr]::
686::$$$message_0001_0003_0002$$$::My foggy head and indistinct thoughts, steeped in the cold, awaken as a distinct entity.::
687::$$$message_0001_0004_0000$$$::"...Whew."[lr]::
688::$$$message_0001_0004_0001$$$::I look up at the night sky and heave a sigh.[lr]::
689::$$$message_0001_0004_0002$$$::It was a busy day, but a peaceful one, no doubt.::
690::$$$message_0001_0005_0000$$$::My daily life doesn't need to change.[lr]::
691::$$$message_0001_0005_0001$$$::They're all here, the various factors connecting each of my days.[lr]::
692::$$$message_0001_0005_0002$$$::The right way for a human to live is by enjoying the slight changes bridging yesterday to today, and today to tomorrow.::
693::$$$message_0001_0006_0000$$$::"...No, that's wrong."[lr]::
694::$$$message_0001_0006_0001$$$::My thoughts grind to a halt.[lr]::
695::$$$message_0001_0006_0002$$$::There's something else.[lr]::
696::$$$message_0001_0006_0003$$$::Another reason why I came here.::
697::$$$message_0001_0007_0000$$$::"...Found you."[lr]::
698::$$$message_0001_0007_0001$$$::I finally reach the entrance.[lr]::
699::$$$message_0001_0007_0002$$$::The shadow runs toward the area behind the temple, tempting me.[lr]::
700::$$$message_0001_0007_0003$$$::I...::

